437:		    it this default fell out of the switch into the SECOND
438:		    switch below, whose default printed a second line for the
439:		    same call -- measured 2.00 host lines per store call.  r is
440:		    still 0 and the tail below only masks it to 32 bits, so
441:		    returning here yields exactly what the old path returned.  */
442:		if (!store_badfmt_warned) {
443:			store_badfmt_warned = 1;
444:			fatal("ieee_store_float_value(): unimplemented format"
