The debugger assignments reach `cd.sh.fpul`, and the existing three-instruction path executes FCNVSD, STS, then the memory store. The DRn controls will catch an identity body if FR2 and FR3 are explicitly seeded. The current probe has 36 sessions; the proposed eight rows bring it to 52, with the dictionary-based discriminator count staying at nine.
